: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">to create an allocation   base. The company uses an adjusted MMF that utilizes a combination of gross</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><br/></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><br/></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><br/></td>  <td colspan="5" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">margin (33%), gross   property (33%), and direct labor (33%) costs to create its allocation base.</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><br/></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><br/></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><br/></